- Needs `name` (stays in SessionApp? or also moved?). The user only mentioned countSignal → CounterControls. Name stays in SessionApp (or could be a TextField component but user didn't ask).

SessionApp:
```java
private final CounterView root;
private final CounterControls controls;
private final WritableSignal<String> name;

SessionApp(...) {
